PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F128A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCNostalgic wartime music
OL,4,Caccompanies Pages from Ceefax on VE Day
OL,5,Canniversary
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo special tapes of sombre light
OL,8,Finstrumental music were compiled
OL,9,Fspecifically to accompany Ceefax during
OL,10,Fthe Falklands War although they
OL,11,Fremained in normal use for more than
OL,12,Ftwo years afterwards.
OL,14,FHowever the VE Day music was different.
OL,15,FIt was an attempt to add to the mood of
OL,16,Fan important day.
OL,18,FThe 40th anniversary of VE Day was the
OL,19,Ffirst to be marked quite so
OL,20,Fextensively.
OL,23,APub: 07-May-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,129,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12806
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F128A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCNostalgic wartime music
OL,4,Caccompanies Pages from Ceefax on VE Day
OL,5,Canniversary
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn those days Presentation was often
OL,8,Fmindful of trying to set the right
OL,9,Ftone. It was about far more than
OL,10,Fmarketing and playout.
OL,12,FIn its own way, this helped to define
OL,13,Fthe character of BBC Television and
OL,14,Fgive it a distinctive feel.
OL,23,APub: 07-May-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,129,120,200,300,0,100
