OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCNostalgic wartime music
OL,4,Caccompanies Pages from Ceefax on VE Day
OL,5,Canniversary
OL,6,
OL,7,GANOTHER OUTING FOR THE VE DAY MUSIC
OL,9,FAfter I write this article, a beautiful
OL,10,Ffootnote emerged.
OL,12,FThe special VE Day music was played
OL,13,Fagain on the 50th anniversary of VE Day
OL,14,Fin 1995.
OL,16,FBy then Ceefax was confined to short
OL,17,Fslots, usually of 15 minutes, before
OL,18,Fthe first programme of the day.
OL,20,FThe opening on 8th May is particularly
OL,21,Feffective.
OL,23,APub: 07-May-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,129,120,200,300,0,100
