OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCNostalgic wartime music
OL,4,Caccompanies Pages from Ceefax on VE Day
OL,5,Canniversary
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe music carried on briefly over the
OL,8,Fclock as Roger Maude announced a
OL,9,Fspecial edition of Breakfast News.
OL,11,FIt is interesting that the special
OL,12,Fcompilations were kept. Did someone
OL,13,Fforesee their reuse?
OL,23,APub: 07-May-2025Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
